 # AGENT.md — Agent Guidelines & Repository Context
+
+Store assistant `marketplace-chat-v2` returns a checked `reply`, never raw settings
+labels/booleans/enums. Reuse Inbox dialect/policy renderers and marketplace payment
+eligibility; the model selects intent/evidence, never executes or confirms orders.
+Keep exact eligible policy passages, shop isolation and pre-inference owner quota
+reservation. Run marketplace-assistant regressions without live providers.
+
+Marketplace phone OTP recovery is unavailable: both legacy endpoints return 503
+with no challenge, order lookup or identity mutation. No verified phone delivery
+service exists here. Never restore demo codes, fixed substitutes or memory fallback.
+Any future recovery must provide delivered, caller/account-bound, rate-limited,
+atomic one-use proof and retain normal account/provenance checks. Run
+`test_marketplace_recovery_scope.py`; do not add a public Store recovery proxy.
+
+New product-image objects are tracked by their AsyncSession transaction. Preserve
+commit/savepoint promotion and rollback/close cleanup in `product_images`; never
+delete committed or deduplicated assets. Storage threads finish before cancellation
+can clean their files. Normal API and worker sessions share these hooks. Cleanup is
+best effort during storage outages; process-crash/uncertain-commit reconciliation
+is not provided by the in-memory registry. Run upload-transaction, marketplace-craft,
+storage/delivery, display/link and craft-checkout regressions without live storage.
+
+Catalog policy import shares Brain's `resolve_ai_store(write_scope="brain")` gate
+for both policy-only/duplicate-only and product-plus-policy imports. Authorize
+after catalog quota locking and before generation or writes; retain the store lock
+through sync/commit. `not_found` retirement needs the same permission. Product-only
+imports with `save_store_knowledge=false` keep their existing flow. Run catalog
+policy-permission, website-policy, AI-store-access and import regressions.
+
+Product-image signing requires a loaded same-business product/gallery/asset binding;
+never infer upload authority from an external URL containing an asset UUID. All
+catalog URL writers reject asset-reference URLs without the owned upload path.
+Permanent image readers and backfill must load bindings before resolving the asset.
+Run catalog-display, public-image-link, product-set and photo-reply regressions.
+
+Marketplace finder quota is reserved with `consume_merchant_ai_quota(commit=False)`
+before provider work. Keep canonical owner/store/credit locks through inference;
+commit a successful reply and roll back unavailable results, errors or cancellation.
+The gateway must not commit the caller's transaction. Same-owner consumers wait
+during the bounded gateway call. Run `test_marketplace_assistant.py`, including its
+disposable PostgreSQL final-unit race cases; never use a production database/model.

 Catalog browsing shares a 10-product page across WhatsApp, Messenger, Instagram
 and Playground. Preserve the server-owned filter/cursor on More; navigation cards
